<p>Every component passes <code>as</code>, <code>className</code> and any other prop through, so <code>&lt;Card as="a" href="/post"&gt;</code> is a linked card.</p>

<h2>Not a web page</h2>
<p>A thumbnail, a video edit, a deck, a poster, a native app: take the values, not the CSS. <code>tokens.json</code> has every colour resolved to hex, and the <a href="/guides/ai/">MCP server</a> answers <code>brand</code> (the whole look in one answer), <code>brief</code> (a recipe for a thumbnail, a video, a carousel, slides, a poster…) and <code>image_prompt</code> (art that stays in the look).</p>
